- [core] include `react-tap-event-plugin@^2.0.0` for `react@^15.4.0` (#5572)
- [core] Add support for Webpack 2/Rollup tree shaking (#5545)

#### Docs

- [docs] Upgrade React to v15.4.0 (#5575)

